lass="reference"><a href="#cite_note-6"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>6<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup></li><li>Solid:</li><li>0.9167 g/mL at 0 °C<sup id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTELide2003Properties_of_Ice_and_Supercooled_Water_in_Section_6_7-0" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTELide2003Properties_of_Ice_and_Supercooled_Water_in_Section_6-7"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>7<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></div>
