<td>0.00&#160;°C (32.00&#160;°F; 273.15&#160;K) <sup id="cite_ref-VSMOW_18-0" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-VSMOW-18"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>b<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="/wiki/Boiling_point" title="Boiling point">Boiling point</a>
</td>
