<tr>
<td><a href="/wiki/Solubility" title="Solubility">Solubility</a>
</td>
<td>Poorly soluble in <a href="/wiki/Haloalkane" title="Haloalkane">haloalkanes</a>, <a href="/wiki/Aliphatic" class="mw-redirect" title="Aliphatic">aliphatic</a> and <a href="/wiki/Aromatic" class="mw-redirect" title="Aromatic">aromatic</a> hydrocarbons, <a href="/wiki/Ether" title="Ether">ethers</a>.<sup id="cite_ref-chemister_8-0" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-chemister-8"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>8<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup> <br /> Improved solubility in <a href="/wiki/Carboxylate" title="Carboxylate">carboxylates</a>, <a href="/wiki/Alcohols" class="mw-redirect" title="Alcohols">alcohols</a>, <a href="/wiki/Ketones" class="mw-redirect" title="Ketones">ketones</a>, <a href="/wiki/Amines" class="mw-redirect" title="Amines">amines</a>. <br /> Miscible with <a href="/wiki/Methanol" title="Methanol">methanol</a>, <a href="/wiki/Ethanol" title="Ethanol">ethanol</a>, <a href="/wiki/Propanol" title="Propanol">propanol</a>, <a href="/wiki/Isopropanol" class="mw-redirect" title="Isopropanol">isopropanol</a>, <a href="/wiki/Acetone" title="Acetone">acetone</a>, <a href="/wiki/Glycerol" title="Glycerol">glycerol</a>, <a href="/wiki/1,4-dioxane" class="mw-redirect" title="1,4-dioxane">1,4-dioxane</a>, <a href="/wiki/Tetrahydrofuran" title="Tetrahydrofuran">tetrahydrofuran</a>, <a href="/wiki/Sulfolane" title="Sulfolane">sulfolane</a>, <a href="/wiki/Acetaldehyde" title="Acetaldehyde">acetaldehyde</a>, <a href="/wiki/Dimethylformamide" title="Dimethylformamide">dimethylformamide</a>, <a href="/wiki/Dimethoxyethane" title="Dimethoxyethane">dimethoxyethane</a>, <a href="/wiki/Dimethyl_sulfoxide" title="Dimethyl sulfoxide">dimethyl sulfoxide</a>, <a href="/wiki/Acetonitrile" title="Acetonitrile">acetonitrile</a>. <br /> Partially miscible with <a href="/wiki/Diethyl_ether" title="Diethyl ether">diethyl ether</a>, <a href="/wiki/Methyl_ethyl_ketone" class="mw-redirect" title="Methyl ethyl ketone">methyl ethyl ketone</a>, <a href="/wiki/Dichloromethane" title="Dichloromethane">dichloromethane</a>, <a href="/wiki/Ethyl_acetate" title="Ethyl acetate">ethyl acetate</a>, <a href="/wiki/Bromine" title="Bromine">bromine</a>.
</td></tr>








