</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/c98f631ceff162aba820c2e0db685fdb54c0c000" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-display mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -2.171ex; width:19.066ex; height:6.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\frac {dT}{dP}}={\frac {T\left(v_{\text{L}}-v_{\text{S}}\right)}{L_{\text{f}}}}}"></span>
</p><p>where <span class="mwe-math-element"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"  alttext="{\displaystyle v_{\text{L}}}">
